        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet Desktop Adventure is a desktop tower defend game. Defeat waves of enemies, get mysterious eggs and collect different pet animals. While you do your own things, adding a little fun to your desktop! if you are tired of battling, you can also enjoy watching your little companies wandering in the base you decorated yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/b37b26bb21d3a0dede1b5c06224f536c.poster.avif?t=1762157854\" width=1138 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/b37b26bb21d3a0dede1b5c06224f536c.webm?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/b37b26bb21d3a0dede1b5c06224f536c.mp4?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/0c473776f58f38d852f0329e3a681840.avif?t=1762157854\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins and decorate your base with different decorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Some have special functions that will help you take care of your pets or help you with your battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All kinds of decorations, there is also one you like.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/0a802e5e63825cb1d980423ec5d6f39a.poster.avif?t=1762157854\" width=1138 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/0a802e5e63825cb1d980423ec5d6f39a.webm?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/0a802e5e63825cb1d980423ec5d6f39a.mp4?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/5f0285c67a371dab0e16e5da4c56e05b.avif?t=1762157854\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go! Let's defeat all enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your pets to form a team. Each pet has different abilities, choose carefully to make a powerful team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies will not be defeated easily. All kinds of enemies are waiting for you, some are especially powerful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/e91115aafb392cc3df4fe9dba244877a.poster.avif?t=1762157854\" width=1138 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/e91115aafb392cc3df4fe9dba244877a.webm?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/e91115aafb392cc3df4fe9dba244877a.mp4?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/09ef57265818ed23ed9a4ece5fb25008.avif?t=1762157854\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After winning, you will find mysterious eggs. What will hatch? So excited!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch eggs, collect new animals and form a unstopable adventure team!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/032be23dcb8eafb371e6d92a3c330399.poster.avif?t=1762157854\" width=1138 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/032be23dcb8eafb371e6d92a3c330399.webm?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/032be23dcb8eafb371e6d92a3c330399.mp4?t=1762157854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you got any questions feel free to contact us by email.</p>",
